WEBVTT

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:56.387
Realizing that there was no way
for her to return to the Human Realm...

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:59.719
...Arusu made up her mind to stay
put in this world and become a witch.

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:03.896
And she let everyone know
how she felt about magic...

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:07.397
That as long as one believes with
all their heart, anyone can use magic.

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:10.594
That magic should be used
to make others happy.

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:15.138
And without any help from anybody,
she put those ideas into action.

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:50.167
Tweeny Witches

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:59.134
Witches' Tradition

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:07.581
We should assume that this is
merely the calm before the storm.

00:03:08.187 --> 00:03:10.451
But we were told that
the general population...

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:12.491
...never realized what was going on.

00:03:12.558 --> 00:03:16.517
There is a far more troublesome lot.
Or have you forgotten?

00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:18.287
You can't mean...

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:23.159
I'm certain that they became aware
after the commotion the other day...

00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:27.634
...that the fairies have escaped
from the barrier of Witch Heaven.

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:29.039
But then...

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:32.339
Meaning it is only
a matter of time before...

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:36.882
...they start going after
the special fairy species.

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:42.512
And should the True Book of Spells
also be in their hands...

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:44.317
You can't be serious!

00:03:44.457 --> 00:03:47.518
That's right. The True Book of Spells
has always been...

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:48.904
...with you, Grand Master.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:51.659
...with you, Grand Master.
It was taken away by someone...

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:53.458
.14 years ago.

00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:56.267
You knew all along?

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:59.669
Surely you didn't think I was unaware?

00:04:02.441 --> 00:04:04.409
One, two, three...

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.039
Sheila...

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:08.214
Sheila!

00:04:12.818 --> 00:04:14.411
What do you think you're doing?

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:17.855
A spell that makes anybody turn
around when you call their name!

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:18.823
Ridiculous!

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:22.725
Yeah, but I've been calling you,
and you keep ignoring me, Sheila!

00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:26.298
Hmm... Wonder what it could be...

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:29.161
Magic to make people happy, my foot!

00:04:29.635 --> 00:04:31.763
I'll never accept anything like that!

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:35.569
Arusu, I want you to help Sheila.

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:37.066
Help her?

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.374
Because I feel so sorry for her.

00:04:39.478 --> 00:04:41.071
She's all alone, you know!

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:44.117
She doesn't believe in anyone.
Really, the poor thing!

00:04:44.217 --> 00:04:48.814
Well, I don't know if you'd call
this helping her exactly, but...

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:50.514
But... But what?

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:53.820
Listen, Eva, have you
ever seen Sheila laugh?

00:04:54.026 --> 00:04:54.652
Huh?

00:04:55.561 --> 00:04:56.653
| don't think so.

00:04:57.363 --> 00:05:00.196
I trust the fairy capturing's
going well?

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:03.131
I'm on my way out now.

00:05:04.403 --> 00:05:07.998
If you don't do your job right,
it causes problems for us.

00:05:08.074 --> 00:05:10.008
| mean, thanks to you...

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:13.569
...that trio even took
away our jobs, you know!

00:05:14.046 --> 00:05:17.072
So you just blame every
last thing on other people?

00:05:17.183 --> 00:05:17.945
Huh?

00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:22.746
You were fired because they had
no faith in your skills. That's all!

00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:24.333
Arusu, I've never seen Sheila laugh!

00:05:24.357 --> 00:05:26.101
Arusu, I've never seen Sheila laugh!
You got a problem with that?

00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:26.614
Arusu, I've never seen Sheila laugh!

00:05:26.726 --> 00:05:27.784
Shh...

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:32.959
Would you dare speak that way
in front of Atelia, I wonder?

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.694
You've been summoned by Atelia.

00:05:37.236 --> 00:05:38.863
Why didn't you say so sooner?

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:40.095
Let's go, Eva.

00:05:40.172 --> 00:05:40.661
Huh?

00:05:41.107 --> 00:05:42.575
You're coming too.

00:05:42.642 --> 00:05:43.336
What?

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:47.002
Yay!

00:05:49.148 --> 00:05:51.913
Come on. I'm telling you
that's no good, Sheila!

00:05:51.984 --> 00:05:56.114
No matter how those two were acting,
you shouldn't talk like that!

00:05:56.255 --> 00:05:57.416
Smile, smile!

00:05:57.523 --> 00:06:00.788
Three, two, one. Smile for me!

00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:05.122
Okay then, I'm gonna use a spell!

00:06:05.298 --> 00:06:07.289
Tickle, tickle, tickle, tickle, tickle!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.890
What the hell are you doing?

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:10.127
Sheila!

00:06:16.976 --> 00:06:19.411
It's possible that
Grande's warlock tribe...

00:06:19.478 --> 00:06:21.606
...may be coming to steal the fairies.

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:22.510
Warlocks?

00:06:22.615 --> 00:06:25.107
Due to the incident the other day,
they have realized that...

00:06:25.184 --> 00:06:26.549
...the fairies have escaped.

00:06:26.652 --> 00:06:28.142
Hey, what are warlocks?

00:06:28.254 --> 00:06:30.780
You see, warlocks are... Um...

00:06:30.856 --> 00:06:32.324
Males who use magic!

00:06:33.292 --> 00:06:35.124
So there are male witches too, huh?

00:06:35.227 --> 00:06:38.288
Oh, I see. They're men,
so they can't be called witches.

00:06:38.397 --> 00:06:39.174
Well then... Well then...

00:06:39.198 --> 00:06:40.825
Well then... Well then...
Just shut up for a second!

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:45.365
Our top priority is to
make sure that not a...

00:06:45.438 --> 00:06:47.770
...single fairy falls into their hands.

00:06:47.907 --> 00:06:49.170
And if push comes to shove...

00:06:49.241 --> 00:06:51.573
You have permission
to attack the warlocks.

00:06:51.644 --> 00:06:52.577
What?

00:06:53.312 --> 00:06:57.806
But isn't it the witches' tradition
never to attack the warlocks?

00:06:57.917 --> 00:07:00.147
She's right! That would
be ridiculous, wouldn't it?

00:07:00.252 --> 00:07:03.347
Witches are all about smiling!
Magic flasks are for keeping your drinks hot...

00:07:03.422 --> 00:07:06.187
...and magic is for making
people happy, remember?

00:07:06.292 --> 00:07:07.760
This is a war.

00:07:08.394 --> 00:07:09.259
A war?

00:07:09.829 --> 00:07:11.661
We are fighting to defend...

00:07:11.731 --> 00:07:14.757
...the magical traditions
that we have always followed.

00:07:16.469 --> 00:07:17.300
Understood.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.338
Hey, Sheila!

00:07:19.438 --> 00:07:21.805
Sheila! Wait! Wait!

00:07:24.343 --> 00:07:25.640
By the way, Arusu...

00:07:25.711 --> 00:07:26.200
Huh?

00:07:26.946 --> 00:07:30.541
Is it true that the ecoo fairy made
the magic book vanish into thin air?

00:07:30.649 --> 00:07:33.311
That's right. What's up
with that book, anyway?

00:07:33.419 --> 00:07:35.649
Just what would my dad be
doing with a book like that?

00:07:35.755 --> 00:07:37.951
Stop holding out on me
and give me an answer!

00:07:38.057 --> 00:07:39.491
You are dismissed.

00:07:40.159 --> 00:07:40.853
Hey!

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:44.157
Just so you know, I'm not
gonna let Sheila go into battle!

00:07:44.263 --> 00:07:45.628
Let go of me!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.761
Listen, Sheila... It's not possible!

00:07:49.869 --> 00:07:52.361
Let's not do it!
We can't go into battle! Hey...

00:07:53.839 --> 00:07:54.738
Sheila?

00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:57.710
Our top priority is to
make sure that not a...

00:07:57.777 --> 00:07:59.768
...single fairy falls into their hands.

00:08:01.614 --> 00:08:05.016
If push comes to shove, you have
permission to attack the warlocks.

00:08:05.584 --> 00:08:07.780
Sheila, wait! Could that be...

00:08:08.154 --> 00:08:09.246
You stay back.

00:08:09.789 --> 00:08:11.985
Sheila! I'm telling you not to do it!

00:08:12.758 --> 00:08:15.159
Kill or be killed...
That's what war is all about.

00:08:16.429 --> 00:08:17.294
Sheila!

00:08:19.198 --> 00:08:20.165
It's you!

00:08:20.399 --> 00:08:23.232
Oh, my! If it isn't little Eva!

00:08:23.335 --> 00:08:26.361
Look at you. You've gotten so big!

00:08:26.939 --> 00:08:27.872
Um...

00:08:27.973 --> 00:08:30.670
Oh, silly girl!
Just a joke, just a joke.

00:08:30.776 --> 00:08:33.302
And while I'm at it, here's some chalk!

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:35.791
Hey, that's pretty good, lady!

00:08:35.815 --> 00:08:37.783
Hey, that's pretty good, lady!
Thank you. So you can tell?

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.543
Listen, who are you, anyway?

00:08:39.618 --> 00:08:41.279
Well, you see...

00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:42.664
What are you doing here?

00:08:42.688 --> 00:08:44.816
What are you doing here?
Do you even have to ask?

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:47.450
I'm here to see you...
my darling only daughter!

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:49.824
| have no business with you.
Just get out of my sight.

00:08:49.895 --> 00:08:52.421
Well! There you go again, Miss Bashful!

00:08:52.498 --> 00:08:54.262
You're too cute, you know.

00:08:54.333 --> 00:08:55.043
| really missed you, you know.

00:08:55.067 --> 00:08:58.264
| really missed you, you know.
Is it just me, or are we exactly alike?

00:08:58.604 --> 00:09:00.698
That's her mom. Sheila's mom.

00:09:00.806 --> 00:09:02.296
Huh? For real?

00:09:03.776 --> 00:09:05.437
In this world, you see...

00:09:05.544 --> 00:09:08.878
...if you don't get sent to the Human Realm,
but also can't get an official post...

00:09:08.948 --> 00:09:11.713
...then you have to marry into
the warlock tribe that lives...

00:09:11.784 --> 00:09:13.149
...on the other side of the mountain.

00:09:13.252 --> 00:09:15.482
And, see... if you have a baby boy...

00:09:15.588 --> 00:09:17.955
...he lives with you
in the Warlock Realm.

00:09:18.057 --> 00:09:22.426
And if you have a baby girl, she's
raised apart from her warlock daddy...

00:09:22.495 --> 00:09:24.862
...and lives in the Witch Realm. But...

00:09:25.364 --> 00:09:29.096
But Sheila's mom ended up
choosing the warlock daddy.

00:09:29.201 --> 00:09:30.930
And she abandoned Sheila...

00:09:31.103 --> 00:09:35.131
Oh? And that's why she never laughs?

00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:36.117
You think so?

00:09:36.141 --> 00:09:37.700
You think so?
Come on, you see it all the time!

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.801
On those talk shows on TV...
Oh, wait...

00:09:39.879 --> 00:09:42.177
| guess you don't have talk shows here.

00:09:47.219 --> 00:09:48.516
Sheila!

00:09:48.587 --> 00:09:50.453
My darling, sweet little Sheila!

00:09:51.223 --> 00:09:55.456
I've baked a cake for you!
A delicious cake fresh out of the oven!

00:09:55.561 --> 00:09:55.937
See? See?

00:09:55.961 --> 00:09:57.360
See? See?
That's enough, for God's sake!

00:09:57.596 --> 00:09:59.428
But it's a yummy cake.

00:10:00.666 --> 00:10:03.363
The truth is you just broke up
with some man or something, right?

00:10:03.435 --> 00:10:05.301
Bingo! That's correct!

00:10:05.871 --> 00:10:08.101
| guess we are mother
and daughter after all!

00:10:08.173 --> 00:10:09.217
It's no use trying to depend on me.

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:09.707
It's no use trying to depend on me.
What?

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:12.938
I've been on my own all this time.
And that's how it's always to be.

00:10:13.045 --> 00:10:16.208
No way am I gonna let you
drag me down at this late date.

00:10:16.482 --> 00:10:19.281
Well, you're wrong about that, you know.

00:10:19.418 --> 00:10:20.262
Then what's going on?

00:10:20.286 --> 00:10:21.276
Then what's going on?
| just came...

00:10:21.353 --> 00:10:23.287
...to see my daughter's face.

00:10:23.389 --> 00:10:24.754
Don't tell me you're...

00:10:24.823 --> 00:10:26.621
Yes! You're absolutely right!

00:10:26.692 --> 00:10:27.887
At least I think so.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.204
You're spying for the warlocks?

00:10:29.228 --> 00:10:29.888
You're spying for the warlocks?
Huh?

00:10:30.195 --> 00:10:33.722
You were told by some warlock
to come down here and spy on us!

00:10:34.033 --> 00:10:35.523
Don't you think you're out of line?

00:10:35.601 --> 00:10:37.035
You're way out of line.

00:10:37.102 --> 00:10:39.400
That's right. I even baked
you a cake, you know.

00:10:39.471 --> 00:10:40.097
Shut up!

00:10:40.205 --> 00:10:42.572
Don't tell her to shut up!
She's your mother, isn't she?

00:10:42.641 --> 00:10:45.133
And what if she is in trouble
and needs to depend on you?

00:10:45.244 --> 00:10:47.679
That's what families do.
Help each other out in times of trouble!

00:10:47.746 --> 00:10:50.647
That's right! That's right!
Arusu is absolutely right!

00:10:50.716 --> 00:10:53.344
That's right! That's right!
| baked you a cake! It's delicious!

00:10:53.452 --> 00:10:54.681
That's right! That's right!

00:10:54.753 --> 00:10:56.152
Just shut up!

00:10:57.289 --> 00:10:59.781
What do you mean, mother and
daughter? For crying out loud...

00:10:59.892 --> 00:11:01.189
You're alone too, aren't you?

00:11:01.293 --> 00:11:03.057
You're planning to
live here, aren't you?

00:11:03.128 --> 00:11:05.460
What do you mean,
help each other out and family?

00:11:05.564 --> 00:11:09.000
You can't survive here if you keep
saying idealistic things like that!

00:11:11.003 --> 00:11:12.514
I'm going out to capture some fairies.

00:11:12.538 --> 00:11:13.369
I'm going out to capture some fairies.
Sheila!

00:11:14.073 --> 00:11:15.768
| don't know what to do.

00:11:20.245 --> 00:11:22.373
The battle had already begun.

00:11:22.481 --> 00:11:24.848
And it was closer than we thought.

00:11:32.691 --> 00:11:35.683
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:44.659
Happy Birthday

00:11:56.148 --> 00:11:57.047
There it is!

00:12:02.521 --> 00:12:03.750
You're not getting away!

00:12:06.492 --> 00:12:07.254
Gotcha!

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:19.269
Mrs. M?

00:12:19.338 --> 00:12:19.981
Sheila's mom!

00:12:20.005 --> 00:12:20.938
Sheila's mom!
It's nothing.

00:12:21.006 --> 00:12:22.384
A drunk just walked over my grave.

00:12:22.408 --> 00:12:23.273
A drunk just walked over my grave.
A drunk walked...

00:12:23.342 --> 00:12:24.275
A goose!

00:12:24.343 --> 00:12:27.540
You should have said a drunk goose
walked over your grave!

00:12:27.613 --> 00:12:29.547
Good one! Hey, you're pretty good!

00:12:29.615 --> 00:12:30.275
Thanks!

00:12:30.549 --> 00:12:32.984
Never mind that! What kind of
bad feeling did you just get?

00:12:33.052 --> 00:12:36.022
| don't know... I'm wondering if
she's in some kind of pickle...

00:12:36.388 --> 00:12:37.685
Pickles?

00:12:37.756 --> 00:12:39.451
Pickle! You know, trouble!

00:12:39.625 --> 00:12:42.287
Wait a sec, I'm not the straight man here!
I'm supposed to be the dope.

00:12:42.428 --> 00:12:43.691
By bad feeling, do you mean...

00:12:48.033 --> 00:12:49.558
Let me go! Let me go!

00:12:54.707 --> 00:12:55.503
You guys...

00:12:55.574 --> 00:12:57.975
No, no, it's not what it looks like.

00:12:58.277 --> 00:13:01.770
The warlocks stole the fairies.
We barely escaped being killed.

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:05.180
I'm sure you've been told that the warlocks
are now going after the fairies too.

00:13:05.284 --> 00:13:05.773
Yes.

00:13:05.951 --> 00:13:09.444
Just a word of advice. You'll be better off
if you stop this fairy capturing.

00:13:09.555 --> 00:13:11.990
We're no match for
those warlocks, you see!

00:13:13.025 --> 00:13:14.618
What do you think you're doing?

00:13:14.727 --> 00:13:17.128
No matter what we say,
she's not going to listen.

00:13:17.896 --> 00:13:21.093
Since you saved our lives,
I'm going to warn you about one thing.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.664
Watch out for the trap they've set.

00:13:25.871 --> 00:13:27.839
What did they mean by trap?

00:13:39.918 --> 00:13:41.215
What are you doing here?

00:13:41.453 --> 00:13:44.889
Well, your mom said she got
a bad feeling about you, so...

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:45.600
She said that?

00:13:45.624 --> 00:13:47.023
She said that?
Are you all right?

00:13:47.159 --> 00:13:48.388
Sheila!

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:51.791
Don't let down your guard!
There are warlocks hiding close by!

00:13:52.598 --> 00:13:55.568
Well, that's because you're carrying
out this load. They're targeting you!

00:13:55.634 --> 00:13:56.294
Hey!

00:13:57.736 --> 00:13:59.135
Go on, fly away!

00:14:01.073 --> 00:14:02.563
What's you're problem? You're always...

00:14:02.641 --> 00:14:05.133
You're getting that line here
between your eyes again.

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.302
Smile! Smile!

00:14:06.378 --> 00:14:09.439
How the hell can I smile?
| risked my life capturing that fairy!

00:14:09.515 --> 00:14:12.951
Anyway, your mom baked another cake,
so let's go home and eat...

00:14:14.853 --> 00:14:16.412
Ouch...

00:14:17.756 --> 00:14:19.622
Is that another warlock trap?

00:14:23.462 --> 00:14:27.456
Oh no! I squashed a
poor little kabuyon fairy!

00:14:29.468 --> 00:14:31.596
It smells horrible!

00:14:31.703 --> 00:14:35.003
That's what you get
for getting in my way.

00:14:35.641 --> 00:14:37.418
The fairy she let go... What's it called?

00:14:37.442 --> 00:14:38.102
The fairy she let go... What's it called?
Huh?

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:39.839
Don't tell me...

00:14:43.682 --> 00:14:44.979
Ugh, stinky!

00:14:45.083 --> 00:14:48.348
Oh, man, I'm stinky all over!

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.280
Just as I thought.

00:14:53.692 --> 00:14:54.736
Just as you thought what?

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:55.784
Just as you thought what?
Where'd she go?

00:14:55.861 --> 00:15:00.890
Arusu said she was gonna go
wash off that smell in the shower.

00:15:00.999 --> 00:15:02.831
You've got to stop her!

00:15:11.877 --> 00:15:12.810
Ouch...

00:15:13.912 --> 00:15:14.856
Looks like we were too late.

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:16.814
Looks like we were too late.
What is this?

00:15:20.252 --> 00:15:22.619
So you mean Arusu slipping on
the garko fairy bones...

00:15:22.688 --> 00:15:25.089
...stepping on that kabuyon fairy,
and having the shower break on her...

00:15:25.157 --> 00:15:26.682
None of that was a coincidence?

00:15:26.758 --> 00:15:30.717
Right. The yareri fairy that Arusu
let go attaches itself to the witch...

00:15:30.796 --> 00:15:33.663
...who saves it and brings her
endless misfortune.

00:15:33.732 --> 00:15:34.358
Huh?

00:15:34.433 --> 00:15:36.401
Until the day that witch dies.

00:15:36.468 --> 00:15:37.867
So unreasonable!

00:15:37.936 --> 00:15:41.099
It's your own fault for always going
on and on about idealistic stuff!

00:15:41.206 --> 00:15:41.900
Huh?

00:15:42.241 --> 00:15:44.835
Now that you know, don't interfere
when I'm capturing fairies.

00:15:44.943 --> 00:15:46.638
Yeah, you wish!

00:15:46.745 --> 00:15:49.476
I'm telling you to at least
try to look out for yourself.

00:15:51.083 --> 00:15:53.142
And you. Hurry up and leave!

00:15:53.252 --> 00:15:54.913
What are you going to do, Arusu?

00:15:54.987 --> 00:15:57.217
You're going to have eternal misfortune!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:00.752
Wait a minute!
Can't we put this to use, maybe?

00:16:00.859 --> 00:16:01.325
Huh?

00:16:01.393 --> 00:16:02.952
Yes, we can, Eva!

00:16:03.061 --> 00:16:04.722
We can use it!

00:16:04.963 --> 00:16:05.828
Huh?

00:16:08.166 --> 00:16:11.136
Listen up, Eva. Whatever you do,
watch out for those traps.

00:16:11.203 --> 00:16:13.638
| don't want to do this. I'm so scared!

00:16:21.546 --> 00:16:23.378
Oh, not again!

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:26.745
You look so funny!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:28.614
Sorry.

00:16:29.588 --> 00:16:31.784
That's why I told you not to come along.

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:33.756
She's right, Arusu!

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.388
You'd be better off staying
home at Dragon House...

00:16:37.496 --> 00:16:40.124
Hey! If you want to laugh,
go ahead and laugh!

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.729
Aha, I get it now.

00:16:50.375 --> 00:16:51.274
I've spotted one.

00:16:54.346 --> 00:16:55.279
Arusu!

00:16:56.048 --> 00:16:56.879
Arusu!

00:17:04.222 --> 00:17:06.384
Thank goodness.

00:17:09.861 --> 00:17:11.886
Hey, look at me!

00:17:16.668 --> 00:17:18.329
I'm coming, okay?

00:17:20.038 --> 00:17:20.630
Huh?

00:17:20.806 --> 00:17:21.568
Hold on.

00:17:22.341 --> 00:17:26.403
This must be the trap the special
capture squad warned me about.

00:17:26.545 --> 00:17:27.205
What?

00:17:27.946 --> 00:17:29.914
The warlocks have a barrier set up.

00:17:29.982 --> 00:17:32.542
To keep us witches from
being able to do anything.

00:17:32.617 --> 00:17:33.379
You mean...

00:17:33.485 --> 00:17:35.817
We can't fly here. We can't use magic.

00:17:35.921 --> 00:17:37.821
Then what about Arusu?

00:17:37.956 --> 00:17:40.050
That's because she won't listen to us!

00:17:40.125 --> 00:17:42.719
Please. Are you really
still talking like that?

00:17:42.828 --> 00:17:44.353
You still haven't left?

00:17:44.429 --> 00:17:46.420
That's right. I'll stay here
forever if that's...

00:17:46.498 --> 00:17:48.592
...how long it takes
for you to understand.

00:17:48.834 --> 00:17:51.667
Listen to me. That girl...
You see, she's doing it all for you...

00:17:52.104 --> 00:17:53.970
For me?

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:59.302
Arusu was using that bad luck of hers
to try to get you to laugh.

00:18:00.512 --> 00:18:03.573
| came here because I was worried,
and it was just as I thought!

00:18:03.648 --> 00:18:06.618
You can't see what's going on around you
because you only think of yourself.

00:18:06.685 --> 00:18:09.552
Don't act like my mother
all of a sudden!

00:18:09.688 --> 00:18:12.123
Anyway, are you okay
with the way things are?

00:18:14.326 --> 00:18:16.294
Eva, go get a net.

00:18:18.497 --> 00:18:19.521
Ready, set...

00:18:32.677 --> 00:18:34.236
What are you, a moron?

00:18:35.347 --> 00:18:36.337
You laughed!

00:18:37.682 --> 00:18:38.493
Listen, I did not...

00:18:38.517 --> 00:18:39.575
Listen, I did not...
You laughed!

00:18:40.485 --> 00:18:41.095
I did not!

00:18:41.119 --> 00:18:42.143
I did not!
Oh, yes you did!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.688
You saw it too, didn't you, Eva?

00:18:43.755 --> 00:18:45.519
I did! You laughed, Sheila!

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:46.921
I did not laugh!

00:18:51.096 --> 00:18:52.689
You're not going home, are you?

00:18:53.098 --> 00:18:57.057
Never mind that. I want you to drink
all of the antidote I brewed for you.

00:18:57.202 --> 00:19:00.433
Or else you'll die from the
yareri fairy's curse next time.

00:19:00.539 --> 00:19:01.938
This? All of it?

00:19:02.007 --> 00:19:02.565
Yes.

00:19:02.641 --> 00:19:05.008
Sheila... At least see her off...

00:19:05.077 --> 00:19:09.310
It's all right. After all, it looks like
she'll be fine without me now.

00:19:09.681 --> 00:19:11.479
| should be saying that about you.

00:19:22.094 --> 00:19:23.960
Happy birthday!

00:19:24.162 --> 00:19:27.792
I'm so happy that you have
such good friends! Love, Mom.

00:19:29.267 --> 00:19:31.861
But I'm never going to
grow up to be an adult...

00:19:32.971 --> 00:19:34.837
What am I gonna do with her?

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.237
She's already left.

00:19:41.012 --> 00:19:41.911
Sheila...

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:45.710
Hey...

00:19:48.086 --> 00:19:50.578
Want to have some cake?
The three of us?

00:19:51.823 --> 00:19:52.483
Sure!

00:19:54.292 --> 00:19:55.350
Ready?

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:59.628
Happy birthday, Sheila!

00:20:00.031 --> 00:20:03.831
What a happy birthday!

00:20:04.202 --> 00:20:07.866
Congratulations, Sheila!

00:20:16.581 --> 00:20:24.545
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:24.789 --> 00:20:32.789
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:33.965 --> 00:20:41.965
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:43.208 --> 00:20:48.772
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:53.113
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:53.885 --> 00:20:58.118
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:58.223 --> 00:21:02.785
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:02.994 --> 00:21:08.160
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:08.266 --> 00:21:11.327
Let's hope it does.

00:21:12.804 --> 00:21:17.435
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:17.542 --> 00:21:20.034
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:20.145 --> 00:21:28.145
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:29.321 --> 00:21:35.055
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:39.324
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
